### POST /api/v1/auth/register

@host = http://localhost:8080
@email = qa-register@example.com
@username = qa_register
@password = qa-pass-12345


### 201 Created — happy path
POST {{host}}/api/v1/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "{{email}}",
  "username": "{{username}}",
  "password": "{{password}}"
}


### 409 Conflict, AUTH-004 — email already taken (повторно тот же email)
POST {{host}}/api/v1/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "{{email}}",
  "username": "qa_register_other",
  "password": "qa-pass-12345"
}


### 409 Conflict, AUTH-005 — username already taken (другой email, тот же username)
POST {{host}}/api/v1/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "qa-register-other@example.com",
  "username": "{{username}}",
  "password": "qa-pass-12345"
}


### 400, AUTH-001 — invalid email
POST {{host}}/api/v1/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "not-email",
  "username": "qa_user_2",
  "password": "qa-pass-12345"
}


### 400, AUTH-002 — invalid username (короче 3)
POST {{host}}/api/v1/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "qa-shortname@example.com",
  "username": "ab",
  "password": "qa-pass-12345"
}


### 400, AUTH-003 — invalid password (короче 8)
POST {{host}}/api/v1/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "qa-shortpass@example.com",
  "username": "qa_user_3",
  "password": "1234"
}


### 400, AUTH-012 — malformed body
POST {{host}}/api/v1/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{not-json


### 405 Method Not Allowed — GET вместо POST
GET {{host}}/api/v1/auth/register
